# Keyword unmasks for the --capable Plasma workstation set. Copied ONLY when
# CAPABLE. neochat (Matrix) + the newest Plasma point release commonly need
# ~amd64; accept them so the capable build doesn't stall on a keyword mask. Most
# of the curated set is stable on amd64 and needs nothing here.
net-im/neochat ~amd64
# Creative apps in the capable set that upstream keeps ~amd64 (caught on the first
# standalone build — emerge aborts the whole plan on these). Unversioned for
# durability against tree bumps.
media-gfx/krita ~amd64
media-video/obs-studio ~amd64
